SUMMARY:Union Town
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Legendary documentary filmmaker Barbara Kopple completes the wo
 rkers’ trilogy she began fifty years ago with this vivid\, on-the-ground
