SUMMARY:When a Witness Recants
LOCATION:BAMPFA\, 2155 Center St\, Berkeley\, CA 94704
DESCRIPTION:Former lawyer and veteran documentarian Dawn Porter revisits th
 e case of the Harlem Park Three\, whose wrongful convictions as teenagers 
 led to thirty-six years behind bars and exposed profound failures within t
 he American justice system.\nhttps://bampfa.org/event/when-witness-recants
 \nFrom Pushpin Bay Area: https://pushpin.city/bayarea/
URL:https://bampfa.org/event/when-witness-recants
